1323
00:48:19,770 --> 00:48:21,340
Say thank you.

1324
00:48:23,210 --> 00:48:24,509
Thank you.

1325
00:48:24,510 --> 00:48:25,510
Enjoy.

1326
00:48:26,980 --> 00:48:29,439
