- It's good.

1642
00:58:55,200 --> 00:58:56,870
- Is it good?
- Did you like it?

1643
00:58:57,040 --> 00:58:58,139
- I'm glad.
- Come again.

1644
00:58:58,140 --> 00:59:00,310
- We do it for ten days.
- One small...

1645
00:59:00,540 --> 00:59:01,940
Go back safely.

1646
00:59:02,240 --> 00:59:03,339
Bye.

1647
00:59:03,340 --> 00:59:04,780
- Bye, thank you.
- Bye.

1648
00:59:06,050 --> 00:59:09,380
(Today's last customers leave.)

1649
00:59:09,750 --> 00:59:12,089
(Current time: 8:33pm)

1650
00:59:12,090 --> 00:59:13,519
