- Yes?

1653
00:59:16,960 --> 00:59:18,690
I think we made 1,000 dollars today.

1654
00:59:19,690 --> 00:59:21,959
First of all, everyone worked so hard.

1655
00:59:21,960 --> 00:59:24,500
- This is impossible.
- Good job, guys.

1656
00:59:25,130 --> 00:59:27,240
That was the best.

1657
00:59:27,670 --> 00:59:29,070
With the best teammates.

1658
00:59:29,540 --> 00:59:31,540
It's incredible.

1659
00:59:32,070 --> 00:59:33,739
Shall we see how hard we've worked...

1660
00:59:33,740 --> 00:59:36,040
- by checking the sales?
- Okay.

1661
00:59:36,110 --> 00:59:37,979
You got 30 dollars cash?

1662
00:59:37,980 --> 00:59:39,149
It's 29 dollars.

1663
00:59:39,150 --> 00:59:41,519
If I add 29 dollars,

1664
00:59:41,520 --> 00:59:42,620
