- There are so many things to do.

1729
01:01:48,240 --> 01:01:50,309
- It's so nice.
- The general store?

1730
01:01:50,310 --> 01:01:51,849
We must go to the general store.

1731
01:01:51,850 --> 01:01:53,086
Are we doing a city tour on the day off?

1732
01:01:53,110 --> 01:01:55,480
We need to go to Hanaro Mart too.

1733
01:01:55,820 --> 01:01:58,819
And we should take photos in the photo studio too.

1734
01:01:58,820 --> 01:02:00,989
- Like family portrait?
- When we're in good condition.

1735
01:02:00,990 --> 01:02:03,620
I want to take one when we're in good condition.

1736
01:02:04,630 --> 01:02:06,259
So I miss the times...

1737
01:02:06,260 --> 01:02:08,299
